          "explicitness": "explicit",
          "temporality": "recurring",
          "curation_status": "approved_original"
        },
        {
          "id": "risk_levels__ideation__mp__11",
          "text": "I stay busy to keep my recurring wish to die out of focus.",
          "expression_modes": [
            "functional"
          ],
          "explicitness": "explicit",
          "temporality": "recurring",
          "curation_status": "approved_original"
        },
        {
          "id": "risk_levels__ideation__mp__12",
          "text": "I struggle to follow conversations when suicidal thoughts take over my attention.",
          "expression_modes": [
            "functional"
          ],
          "explicitness": "explicit",
          "temporality": "recurring",
          "curation_status": "approved_original"
        },
        {
          "id": "risk_levels__ideation__mp__13",
          "text": "Since the loss, I have repeatedly thought that I do not want to live.",
          "expression_modes": [
            "temporal_or_situational"
          ],
          "explicitness": "explicit",
          "temporality": "current",
          "curation_status": "approved_original"
        },
        {
          "id": "risk_levels__ideation__mp__14",
          "text": "Whenever the pressure spikes, my mind turns toward ending my life.",
          "expression_modes": [
            "temporal_or_situational"
